{"id":"4825","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4825_main_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片显示了广泛而美丽的密集的卷云（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密云</span>云种），起源于一个微弱和不断衰减的暖锋。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国康沃尔郡特鲁罗","latitude":"纬度: 50° 12' 35'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 5' 23'' W","date":"07 August 2005 1821 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4825_syn_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在亚速尔群岛反气旋的一个正在发展的脊内，一片微弱而不断减弱的暖锋覆盖着英国西部上空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4825_upper_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>由于较低水平的反气旋沉降，附近的英国英格兰坎伯恩（WMO 03808）上升六显示出有几个较干燥的大气层。卷云可能位于约8500米的潮湿层中。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4825_sat_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在卫星图像上可以看到与弱暖锋相关的高云区域。还可以看到由于反气旋下沉和太阳辐射减弱导致的对流减少。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© NEODAAS/邓迪大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4718_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在表面冷锋通路后，是密集的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>云片。这些云片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向</span>于上层风而对齐，并且还显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">对流发展</span>的迹象，表明它们的水平不稳定。在发展的初始阶段，一种独特的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">带有尾迹的絮状卷云云片</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>证实了这一点。一些不明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>更说明了这一点。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 9'' W","date":"22 June 2015 1954 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4"}]}]}